# warnings

## MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE

```text
[MODULE_LEVEL_DIRECTIVE] The semantics of the module level directive "use loose" in "entry.js" may not be preserved when bundling.
   ╭─[ entry.js:2:1 ]
   │
 2 │ 'use loose'
   │ ─────┬─────  
   │      ╰─────── module level directive may not be preserved
   │ 
   │ Help: For more information, see https://rolldown.rs/in-depth/directives#other-directives
───╯

